    <briefdescription>
<para>Lock operation failure error. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcslt_1_1LockFailedError" kindref="compound">LockFailedError</ref> represents an error where a mutex, spinlock, or other synchronization primitive fails to acquire or release.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Example Usage:</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>LockFailedError();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>LockFailedError(&quot;Failed<sp/>to<sp/>acquire<sp/>mutex&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
